(#Transition Rules \(Guardrails\)) Tj
T*
(- New -> Contact Attempted: only after outbound event logged.) Tj
T*
(- Contact Attempted -> Engaged: only on two-way interaction.) Tj
T*
(- Engaged -> Quote Ready: only when required intake complete.) Tj
T*
(- Quote Ready -> Proposal Sent: only when quote/proposal actually sent.) Tj
T*
(- Proposal Sent -> Won/Lost: only with explicit outcome event.) Tj
T*
() Tj
